================================================================================
  SUMMARY REPORT: CA Gen to IBM ODM Migration
  Project: Driver License Issuance System (DLIS)
  Output Directory: odm-from-cagen/
================================================================================

WHAT WAS ANALYSED
-----------------
The CA Gen DLIS application was fully read and mapped:

  - 9 Action Blocks (.ACB)     each converted to an ODM ruleflow + BAL rule package
  - 29 Business Rules          all from docs/05-BUSINESS-RULES.md + implicit rules
                               extracted directly from action block source code
  - 7 Entities (.ENT)          all converted to Java BOM classes
  - 8-stage sequential pipeline preserved as gated ruleflows with gate-guard rules


